      "message": "I simply removed this override method and used `DnsPacket.toString()` instead in aosp/2796002 , as all important SVCB information can be printed DnsPacket.toString().\n\nDnsSvcbPacket.toString():\n```\nQUERY: [_dns.resolver.arpa IN SVCB] ANSWER: [_dns.resolver.arpa 86400 IN SVCB 1 dns64.dns.google alpn\u003ddot, _dns.resolver.arpa 86400 IN SVCB 2 dns64.dns.google alpn\u003dh2,h3 dohpath\u003d/dns-query{?dns}] AUTHORITY: [] ADDITIONAL: [DnsRecord{rType\u003d3, dName\u003d\u0027dns.google\u0027, nsType\u003d28, nsClass\u003d1, ttl\u003d86400, mRdata\u003d[32, 1, 72, 96, 72, 96, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 100]}, DnsRecord{rType\u003d3, dName\u003d\u0027dns.google\u0027, nsType\u003d28, nsClass\u003d1, ttl\u003d86400, mRdata\u003d[32, 1, 72, 96, 72, 96, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100]}]\n```\nDnsPacket.toString():\n```\nDnsPacket{header\u003dDnsHeader{id\u003d46948, flags\u003d34176, recordCounts\u003d[1, 2, 0, 2]}, records\u003d\u0027[[_dns.resolver.arpa IN SVCB], [_dns.resolver.arpa 86400 IN SVCB 1 dns64.dns.google alpn\u003ddot, _dns.resolver.arpa 86400 IN SVCB 2 dns64.dns.google alpn\u003dh2,h3 dohpath\u003d/dns-query{?dns}], [], [DnsRecord{rType\u003d3, dName\u003d\u0027dns.google\u0027, nsType\u003d28, nsClass\u003d1, ttl\u003d86400, mRdata\u003d[32, 1, 72, 96, 72, 96, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 100]}, DnsRecord{rType\u003d3, dName\u003d\u0027dns.google\u0027, nsType\u003d28, nsClass\u003d1, ttl\u003d86400, mRdata\u003d[32, 1, 72, 96, 72, 96, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100]}]]}\n```",
